#: ../../technical/articles/111-core-configuration-profile-selection-and-durable-writes.md:24
msgid ""
"`aggregation.py` centralizes distinct axes that could otherwise collapse "
"into ambiguous strings: binding-fold operators, relation-fold operators, "
"row-set grouping, capture provenance, lineage role, and binding-source "
"kind. The source taxonomy spans profile/manual input, invoices, ledgers, "
"prior filings, detail rows, and specialized Modelo 151/210/390 sources. "
"Derived frozensets and an explicit binding-to-row-group mapping keep "
"family membership and differing wire tokens aligned. The module also "
"records legally meaningful input quality: income can be backed by "
"declared substrate or cash fallback; invoice devengo may use a declared "
"operation date or a weaker issue-date proxy; and withholding facts "
"distinguish declared, inferred, absent-substrate, and refused-above-"
"supported-rate cases. These markers preserve why a number was admitted or"
" withheld rather than making downstream readers infer it from nulls or "
"zeroes. Registry-owned vocabularies such as withholding schemes and "
"claves remain opaque validated tokens rather than being copied into core."
