#: ../../technical/articles/111-core-configuration-profile-selection-and-durable-writes.md:26
msgid ""
"Several smaller primitives enforce similarly important distinctions. AEAT"
" CSV shape is checked as a full-match 8–32-character uppercase "
"alphanumeric ID; its normalizer strips and uppercases but does not itself"
" call the shape check, so callers must validate where malformed input is "
"possible. A `CasillaId` validator checks lexical shape only, leaving "
"membership to the selected registry revision. Missing casilla values may "
"be read as zero only through a named reason, and observed casilla text "
"carries an explicit numeric/text/boolean kind so a digit-looking clave is"
" not accidentally parsed as money. Citation grounding separates verified,"
" examined-and-refused, and unavailable-source states. Classifier "
"provenance distinguishes document evidence, taxpayer profile authority, "
"and operator assertion; a printed counterparty tax ID means “taxable "
"person,” not verified IVA registration. aeat_csv.py "
