#: ../../technical/articles/111-core-configuration-profile-selection-and-durable-writes.md:28
msgid ""
"Amendment mechanics accept a registry-projected policy instead of "
"embedding model-specific adoption dates; periods with a date span compare"
" by end date, while date-less periods compare filing year to the boundary"
" year. A separate classifier compares signed baseline and corrected "
"results. Registry authority grades are declared and validated claims, not"
" automatically promoted: an undeclared revision reads at the "
"applicability floor. Other compact axes describe calculation-report "
"serialization, service capabilities, concept lifecycle, and receipt "
"income concepts. Cloud evidence upload defaults off; lifecycle "
"distinguishes draft, approved, deprecated, and retired; `ConceptoIngreso`"
" leaves the income-concept vocabulary to the facts registry. "
