#: ../../technical/articles/111-core-configuration-profile-selection-and-durable-writes.md:32
msgid ""
"`async_cleanup.py` shields one retained cleanup task until terminal state"
" despite repeated caller cancellation. It retries individual closes when "
"requested, retains failed resource owners for another attempt, and "
"attaches cleanup failures to the active body exception or cancellation "
"rather than replacing the primary failure. Merge helpers preserve "
"distinct owners as errors pass through nested scopes. "
"`auth_session_keys.py` provides profile- and provider-partitioned logical"
" object keys for encrypted session storage rather than plaintext "
"destinations. Strict base64 decoding rejects invalid characters and "
"padding; canonical decoding also rejects alternate spellings of identical"
" bytes. The auth-provider description, metadata-invocation recognizer, "
"and Click-context helpers provide shared typed readiness and output-mode "
"facts, including JSON flags held by either upstream Click or Typer’s "
"vendored context chain. async_cleanup.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/async_cleanup.py`) async_cleanup.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/async_cleanup.py`) async_cleanup.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/async_cleanup.py`) async_cleanup.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/async_cleanup.py`) auth_session_keys.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/auth_session_keys.py`) base64_codec.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/base64_codec.py`) base64_codec.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/base64_codec.py`) auth_provider.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/auth_provider.py`) cli_metadata.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/cli_metadata.py`) click_context.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/click_context.py`) click_context.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/click_context.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`async_cleanup.py` protege una tarea retenida de limpieza hasta su estado"
" final pese a cancelaciones repetidas de quien llama. Reintenta cierres "
"individuales cuando se solicita, conserva responsables de recursos "
"fallidos para otro intento y adjunta fallos de limpieza a la excepción "
"activa del cuerpo o cancelación en lugar de sustituir el fallo principal."
" Las funciones auxiliares de combinación conservan responsables distintos"
" al pasar errores por ámbitos anidados. `auth_session_keys.py` "
"proporciona claves lógicas de objetos particionadas por perfil y "
"proveedor para almacenamiento cifrado de sesiones, no destinos en texto "
"claro. La decodificación estricta de base64 rechaza caracteres y relleno "
"no válidos; la decodificación canónica también rechaza representaciones "
